      <link>https://lightpoetrymagazine.com/poem-of-the-week-13/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=poem-of-the-week-13</link>
      <description>The Book on Alex Rodriguez He seeks out BioGenesis To help him beat Ruth’s Numbers And Barry’s tainted Mark (boo! hiss!), While A-Rod’s Wisdom slumbers. If Judges don’t reject the facts Of Revelation‘s probe, It’s Exodus for him, whose Acts Refute his claim he’s Job. --Bob McKenty</description>
